          "text": "Abdominal pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Approximately 3 weeks of vague central/lower abdominal aching. Worse when twisting in bed, not clearly exertional. No sudden onset and no radiation to the back. No vomiting or PR bleeding. Bowels somewhat sluggish at baseline."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
